      "start_seconds": 0.55,
      "end_seconds": 4.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "Good evening, doctor, thanks for seeing me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.65,
      "end_seconds": 10.44,
      "duration_seconds": 4.79,
      "text": "Right, not at all, please sit. What seems to be wrong?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.5,
      "end_seconds": 16.02,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "Hmm, I wanted to get being thirsty looked at."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 17.38,
      "end_seconds": 20.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "What's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 21.66,
      "end_seconds": 24.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "I've had it since yesterday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.25,
      "end_seconds": 29.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.71,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.95,
      "end_seconds": 40.62,
      "duration_seconds": 8.67,
      "text": "Only water, and it's not much. I'd call it severe. It's the not knowing that gets to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.89,
      "end_seconds": 45.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "Right, have you noticed anything else alongside it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.21,
      "end_seconds": 60.41,
      "duration_seconds": 14.2,
      "text": "Slow healing of a small cut goes along with it, most of the time. The slow healing of a small cut? That's been for about a month."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.85,
      "end_seconds": 67.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "Let's start with the basic checks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.89,
      "end_seconds": 80.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.73,
      "end_seconds": 108.41,
      "duration_seconds": 7.68,
      "text": "Okay: heart rate 91, oxygen saturation is 98 percent. And respiratory rate 17, blood pressure 163 over 101."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.45,
      "end_seconds": 114.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "Alright, over here please and I'll take a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.26,
      "end_seconds": 116.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.38,
      "text": "Nearly finished here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.64,
      "end_seconds": 130.08,
      "duration_seconds": 5.44,
      "text": "Your weight is up a little and there are no sores on your feet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.75,
      "end_seconds": 135.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "All finished, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.66,
      "end_seconds": 152.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "Any abdominal pain, weight loss or vomiting at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.66,
      "end_seconds": 156.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "No, no abdominal pain, weight loss or vomiting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.74,
      "end_seconds": 162.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "Has your heart given you any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.83,
      "end_seconds": 168.3,
      "duration_seconds": 5.47,
      "text": "My heart's been fine, uh, as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.31,
      "end_seconds": 191.41,
      "duration_seconds": 6.1,
      "text": "Right, have you got any known allergies? I'll explain everything as we go along."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.38,
      "end_seconds": 194.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "No known allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.49,
      "end_seconds": 197.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 198.61,
      "end_seconds": 200.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "I have thin bones."
